      "date": "2026-05-12T06:44:00.000Z",
      "title": "Onward Technologies Limited (BSE:517536) announces an Equity Buyback for 548,780 shares, representing 2.41% for INR 180 million.",
      "body": "Onward Technologies Limited announces a share repurchase program. Under the program, the company will repurchase up to 548,780 shares, representing 2.41% of its issued share capital, for INR 180 million. The shares will be repurchased at a price of INR 328 per share. The program will be undertaken on a proportionate basis. The program is subject to applicable statutory approvals, as may be required. The company has set May 18, 2026, as the record date of the offer. As of May 8, 2026, the company had 22,753,870 shares outstanding.",
